  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtened legal and institutional environment enabling the full realization of social dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will provide technical assistance on labour prevention and resolution to judicial and non-judicial institutions of the Government of Trinidad and Tobago.  Assistance will include an assessment of the functioning of the Industrial Court and a plan of action to strengthen its effectiveness and training with financial and technical support from the Regional Office for Latin America and the Caribbean.

Beneficiaries include workers, employers and the Industrial Court. The work will be done in collaboration with the Ministry of Labour.</narrative>
  </description>
